'''Watto's box''' was a private viewing box that [[Watto]] used when he attended [[podracing]] events at the [[Mos Espa Grand Arena|Grand Arena]] of [[Mos Espa]]. It was equipped with several [[viewscreen]]s that broadcast transmissions from aerial [[cam droid]]s. Watto hosted viewing parties for his friends and gambling partners in his box.<ref name="Ultimate Star Wars">''[[Ultimate Star Wars]]''</ref> He was present at the [[Boonta Eve Classic]] in [[32 BBY]]<ref name="I">{{Film|I}}</ref>

